    "type": "question",
    "label": "5",
    "prompt": "The surface area in cm² of a balloon being inflated is given by $S=t^3-2t^2+5t+2$, where $t$ is time in seconds. Find the rate of increase in the balloon's surface area at 8 s.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$165\\text{ cm}^2/\\text{s}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{dS}{dt}&=3t^2-4t+5\\\\\\left.\\frac{dS}{dt}\\right|_{t=8}&=3(8)^2-4(8)+5\\\\&=165\\text{ cm}^2/\\text{s}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
